---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="AZIZIFITNESS | Privacy">
  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="container section-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h2>How we handle enquiries</h2>
      <p>When you contact AZIZIFITNESS, we use the details you provide to respond to your enquiry and arrange the requested service. We do not sell your information.</p>
      <p>Public coach profiles show only approved public information such as a name, photo, biography, specialization, and professional links. Private contact details are not published in the public coach directory.</p>
      <p>Enquiries are routed through AZIZIFITNESS so the team can respond without exposing a coach’s private phone number or email address.</p>
      <p>For questions about your information, email <a href="mailto:simonaziz@yahoo.com">simonaziz@yahoo.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
